    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support our Kickstarter! Live NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>Avium, a vast, majestic land where Wilds roam. Follow the main questline and the many side quests to slowly uncover the mysteries of the Omina Comet, command the power of the Wilds, and unite civilization once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> over 200 unique Wilds using your Catalyst, a rare device entrusted to few in Avium. Evolve them  to gain increased base stats, new elements, and access to powerful skills that boost their strength in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble</strong> a diverse team of Wilds and <strong>Battle</strong> rival Catalyst Carriers throughout Avium to become a legend among the townsfolk.\u00a0Strategize your attacks with unique abilities and 18 distinct elemental types, with each Wild possessing up to two elements. Mastering these dynamics will be essential to conquering the many battles ahead in Avium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/32be38d3d7ef43c885bf207a76257082.avif?t=1749256235\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer</strong> challenging sanctuaries  themed to match the many Wild types in Avium. Each offers a bite-sized, brain-teasing challenge packed with clever puzzles and combat trials. Completion grants unique Wilds and powerful items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support our Kickstarter! Live NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>Avium, a vast, majestic land where Wilds roam. Follow the main questline and the many side quests to slowly uncover the mysteries of the Omina Comet, command the power of the Wilds, and unite civilization once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/db9279f117e1b80b2d508383b168737e.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> over 200 unique Wilds using your Catalyst, a rare device entrusted to few in Avium. Evolve them  to gain increased base stats, new elements, and access to powerful skills that boost their strength in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/5197dfa545b182414d86e4f74091c803.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble</strong> a diverse team of Wilds and <strong>Battle</strong> rival Catalyst Carriers throughout Avium to become a legend among the townsfolk.\u00a0Strategize your attacks with unique abilities and 18 distinct elemental types, with each Wild possessing up to two elements. Mastering these dynamics will be essential to conquering the many battles ahead in Avium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/32be38d3d7ef43c885bf207a76257082.avif?t=1749256235\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer</strong> challenging sanctuaries  themed to match the many Wild types in Avium. Each offers a bite-sized, brain-teasing challenge packed with clever puzzles and combat trials. Completion grants unique Wilds and powerful items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.poster.avif?t=1749256235\" width=554 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.webm?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671350/extras/fae36cc05210fcaa783eb4219323e15c.mp4?t=1749256235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
